cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Cross-referencing Tasmanian Terrestrial Ecosystems (TASVEG-XREF)"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible workflow that cross-references the 159 mapping units of
  TASVEG 5.0 ... to the ecosystem functional groups of the IUCN Global
  Ecosystem Typology (GET). ...
version: "0.4"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
